# The only Docker build in this repo is bench/repair_ab_repro/Dockerfile (the repair-ab
# reproduction image — see docs/decisions.md ADR-034). Its build context is the
# repo root so the shared bench/ and llm/ modules are in scope, but it COPYs only
# a handful of files. Everything below is large build output or local-only state
# that is never needed by that image; excluding it keeps the context small
# (tens of MB instead of gigabytes) and keeps secrets out of the build.

.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# C++ / JUCE build trees — gigabytes, never needed by the repair-ab repro image
host/build
host/build-release
host/JUCE
/build
/build-ci
/build-release
cmake-build-*

# release + local capture output
/dist
/artifacts

# local env / secrets — must never enter an image
.env
**/.env
*.pem
*.key
